export const HOUSEHOLD_RHYMES=['Warm loaf, bent reed; take what you need.','Brake shoe, blanket blue; leave a place for someone new.','Rain on the bell, ring and tell; names we remember are names we keep well.','Ink on the quay, letter at sea; leave one lamp burning for somebody.','Hold the rope, mind the sky; nobody crosses on one hand’s try.','Ash to the root, rain to the shoot; never judge spring by the size of its fruit.','River rise, river fall; mark our heights on the shelter wall.','Silt in the seam, seed in the stream; flowers remember what engines dream.','Button and thread, roof overhead; mend what you can before going to bed.','Boot by the fire, soup on the stair; count every traveller, leave someone a chair.','Glass in the light, ask if it’s right; a bright little signal can still hide the night.','Coat on the hook, kettle and book; make enough room for the one overlooked.'];
